{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey James, it's been a bit since we last talked. Something cool happened recently - I volunteered my programming skills for a social cause. It was cool to use my passion to do something good. I made a software tool for one charitable foundation which helped streamline their operations and make them run more smoothly. Seeing my skills making a real difference in the world was really rewarding."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-6b04c9d3c589a765bf000697", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.442905+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6b04c9d3c589a765bf000697", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6b04c9d3c589a765bf000697", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John! Glad to hear from you. It's awesome that you used your skills to make a difference. Bet it was cool to see it in action. Would love to hear more about it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-fe9c4a6693961668ebe80705", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.478050+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fe9c4a6693961668ebe80705", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fe9c4a6693961668ebe80705", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Previously, this foundation used paper records and all inventory was recorded manually. I made an application that structured their work, and now everything they need for inventory is in one application on their smartphone."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-a70537c6c5adea8bcc7ec594", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.494053+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a70537c6c5adea8bcc7ec594", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a70537c6c5adea8bcc7ec594", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Wow John, that's awesome! Must feel great to be part of something so important. I would love to see any visual examples of the impact your software made."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-013590447bf12b2ef1b14f2c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.509602+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "013590447bf12b2ef1b14f2c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "013590447bf12b2ef1b14f2c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, here's a screenshot of the system. It'll make tracking inventory, resources, and donations run smoother and generate reports for analysis. Feels great knowing my skills are making a real difference to them."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-9fa1bf38e8fd4d9fa2079eb8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.526876+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9fa1bf38e8fd4d9fa2079eb8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9fa1bf38e8fd4d9fa2079eb8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Wow John, that's awesome! What motivated you to create such an amazing system for them?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-02b3dced8940c46d4227b88e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.541012+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "02b3dced8940c46d4227b88e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "02b3dced8940c46d4227b88e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I was inspired by their passion for helping kids, so I wanted to contribute in any way I could. Plus, coding lets me challenge myself and expand my skills, so this was a great chance to do both. It's really rewarding to use my coding skills to make a difference."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-528865d44b58469cd96c2c20", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.554861+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "528865d44b58469cd96c2c20", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "528865d44b58469cd96c2c20", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: That's really great, John! It's awesome how you blended your passion with a good cause. How did it affect you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-821f0c2759a85e87942d0ea7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.568539+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "821f0c2759a85e87942d0ea7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "821f0c2759a85e87942d0ea7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: It showed me the power of tech to make positive changes, beyond just my own enjoyment. It gave me a real sense of purpose."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-0bfbbb2ddc8f58797ff174ae", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.586338+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0bfbbb2ddc8f58797ff174ae", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0bfbbb2ddc8f58797ff174ae", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Discovering our passions is truly rewarding. How do you think this experience will impact your future plans?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-142453d74963af3575572adc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.601470+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "142453d74963af3575572adc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "142453d74963af3575572adc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: This experience has given me a clearer sense of purpose and motivated me to use my programming skills to make a positive impact. I'm now considering volunteer roles and potentially a career in the non-profit sector."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-dfda557d696b24b3f4a0791a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.614474+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dfda557d696b24b3f4a0791a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dfda557d696b24b3f4a0791a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: That's really inspiring. Have you found any non-profit organizations that align with your values and passion for programming?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-213947df62178fd76c1db795", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.632509+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "213947df62178fd76c1db795", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "213947df62178fd76c1db795", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I haven\u2019t found it yet, but to be honest I haven\u2019t looked for it. I think it won\u2019t be difficult for me to find the organization I need."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-d333f4bbf3efdd257ca72f8e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.649584+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d333f4bbf3efdd257ca72f8e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d333f4bbf3efdd257ca72f8e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: There are lots of places where you can show off your skills! I'm sure you'll find one that's perfect for you in making a difference."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-1dded27edf31a1cb2ea70c69", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.665880+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1dded27edf31a1cb2ea70c69", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1dded27edf31a1cb2ea70c69", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I'll be happy to find a place where my skills and passions are a perfect match. I'm hoping to make a positive impact there."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-e9a9afd8756e7c6cd6ad04f6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.679348+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e9a9afd8756e7c6cd6ad04f6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e9a9afd8756e7c6cd6ad04f6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: I'm sure you'll find the right spot, John. Your skills and passions will be a great addition. Good luck!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-68e0994048215a521e188fe7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.695447+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "68e0994048215a521e188fe7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "68e0994048215a521e188fe7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, your encouragement means a lot."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-9d66d28808d280dba490060c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.715739+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9d66d28808d280dba490060c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9d66d28808d280dba490060c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: I'm here for you. Good luck!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-a8b279d808c1b86a51968963", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.729716+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a8b279d808c1b86a51968963", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a8b279d808c1b86a51968963", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, James! Appreciate it. Take care and talk soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_11-96db8ea9548227d21cd3e858", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:49:46.744405+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "96db8ea9548227d21cd3e858", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "96db8ea9548227d21cd3e858", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
